  "problem": "If $\\,T\\,$ is a linear transformation and $\\,T([\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}])=[\\begin{aligned}27 \\\\ -18\\end{aligned}]$, then find $T([\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]).$\n\n| $\\,T([\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}])=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |",
